{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3ca131c4-f37e-886a-830e-f97a4ca72510",
  "created_at": "2026-03-08T10:47:12-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:40:28-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:40:33-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. Sorry, one second, your voice is very quiet. I keep pressing the volume. Okay, now better. Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:40:45-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:40:52-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am calling about storm drain on Bridge Street. I know is Sunday, City Hall is closed, so I call this storm line. Is okay to call here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:41:10-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's what this line is for on weekends. Give me the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:41:19-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three twenty-nine Bridge Street, in the Point. It is my mother's house. I am calling for her, she does not like phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:41:33-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 329 Bridge Street. And what's the drain doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:41:39-04:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After the rain Friday and Saturday, yesterday it finished, the water sits in front of the house. The drain is full and does not take. And the driveway apron, at the bottom where it meets the street, it holds a puddle. The puddle goes toward the garage door. Not into the garage yet, but close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:42:12-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water's pooling at the end of the driveway and running back toward the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:42:22-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. This is not first time. Every rain, same thing. Nobody fixes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:42:31-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has someone from the city been out before, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:42:39-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know of this. My mother says she called one time, long ago, nothing happened. I am only telling what I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:42:54-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Did you try anything on your end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:43:00-04:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. This morning I go out with my hand and clean the leaves from the grate. Wet leaves, very thick. After this the water goes down, it helped, but only ten minutes. Then it is full again. So the problem is not only leaves. Something is blocked under."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:43:29-04:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would make sense. If it clears for a few minutes and then backs up, there's probably something further down the line. I'll put that in the report so the crew knows it's not just surface debris."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:43:52-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Please write this. Under, not only leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:43:58-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is the water in the street itself, or just at your driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:44:07-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. In the street, wide puddle, cars go through and it splashes. Then driveway. My mother is afraid to walk out. [pause] Sorry, the volume again. Can you say louder?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:44:26-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, is this better? I said, is the garage door the closest thing the water could reach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:44:37-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, garage door and then the side door. Is wood, it will get damaged if it is every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:44:49-04:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm putting it in as a drain not draining, standing water at the driveway, with a note about the garage. Can I get a callback number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:45:10-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four oh one, five five five, zero one seven six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:45:17-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-six. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:45:22-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Janice Gardiner. G-A-R-D-I-N-E-R. I am the daughter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:45:27-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Janice. That's all in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:45:31-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to ask. Do the crews work on weekends? Because if it is Sunday and nobody comes until Monday, maybe it rains again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:45:46-04:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do respond on weekends when it's something urgent, mostly flooding that's a hazard. Yours is going to get looked at, but it may land Monday or later, depending on what else came in after the storm. It was a busy couple of days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:46:13-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So maybe Monday, maybe later. Okay. It is frustrating, I tell you honestly. Same problem, we report, nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:46:25-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. You've got a record of it now, with the detail about the blockage, which helps get the right crew out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:46:40-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. If water goes to garage tonight, should I call again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:46:47-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call this line again and say it's reached the building. That changes how it gets treated."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:46:58-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I will do. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:47:03-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Tell your mom we're on it. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T10:47:10-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
